  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil. Peel potato and sweet potato and cut into bite-sized chunks.\n• Cook in the boiling water until easily pierced with a fork, 10-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter to potato and sweet potato and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm. TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8102b511ee4a266ae2aa/step-14a42f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, chop broccoli (including stalk!) into small florets. Trim green beans. Finely chop garlic.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook broccoli and green beans, tossing, until tender, 6-8 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Season, then transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm. TIP: Add a dash of water to the pan to help speed up the cooking process.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8102b511ee4a266ae2aa/step-0fbbad10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook broccoli and green beans, tossing, until tender, 6-8 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Season, then transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm. TIP: Add a dash of water to the pan to help speed up the cooking process.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8102b511ee4a266ae2aa/step-f44fec20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8102b511ee4a266ae2aa/step-1de46d30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a second medium bowl, combine gravy granules and the boiling water (1/2 cup for 2 people / 1 cup for 4 people), whisking, until smooth, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8102b511ee4a266ae2aa/step-4da9f540.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide sweet potato mash and garlicky veggies between plates.\n• Top mash with plant-based crumbed chicken, then pour over gravy.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d8102b511ee4a266ae2aa/step-6fffd250.jpg"
    }
  ]
